Package: fractald
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dbus-bin
Description: FractalD service manager and compatibility layer
 FractalD provides a supervised Linux service manager with systemd-style
 unit compatibility, OpenRC adapters, local control tools, an optional
 separately supervised resolver, and a RustyBox Rust/C multi-call userland.
